63	
64		// ServeMux treats the empty document segment in /v1/documents//... as an
65		// unclean path and answers with a 307 HTML redirect (a 404 in a real
66		// client). The API contract is a 400 JSON error, so intercept those paths
67		// before the mux sees them.
